Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# The Supabase service role. Anyone holding it can read and write everything,
# including the bug reports, which carry screenshots of pilots' screens.
# tools/bugs.py reads it from here or from SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY.
.supabase_service_key
bug-*.png
bug-*.jpg
tools/.cache/

# A stub three.js so the physics can be run headless (tools/sim.mjs). The game
# itself takes three from the CDN importmap; nothing here is ever served.
#
# THE STUB ITSELF IS KEPT. It is not a downloaded dependency — it is four
# hundred lines written by hand, and half the checks in tools/ now measure
# things that only exist because of it: the terrain's vertices, the instance
# matrices of the trees and the buildings, whether a geometry is a cone. With
# the whole directory ignored, all of that lived on one machine, and a fresh
# clone would have run the same checks against a stub that answers 0 to
# everything — which is not a failing check, it is a check that passes for the
# wrong reason. It has to travel with the checks that depend on it.
node_modules/*
!node_modules/three/
